    "listen": "",
    "zh": "",
    "stem": "The writer will ______ her new book next month.",
    "opts": [],
    "ans": "publish",
    "why": "出版书用 publish；publicize 是让很多人知道。",
    "kd": "易混"
   },
   {
    "type": "适当形式填空",
